Z||000000||turbo86se||12-11-2000||12:47 AM||||Every night on my way home I drive by my mechanic's house, still hopeing to see my '88 coupe, but tonight I saw his ex-wife's '87 coupe on the back of a flatbed!! He said he was getting it back! When they divorced she moved to Jacksonville, FL and took the Fiero, which is in his name. As I was driving by, I noticed the mint white '88 coupe next to the '86 GT with a sweet Ferrari Dino rebody kit (both for sale), his 200K mile Formula, and his 3.8 '86 coupe, then I noticed the blue coupe sitll on the flatbed!!  LOL <P>So if any of you Jacksonville guys saw a blue '87 coupe on the back of a flatbed today, it was my mechanic, Mike!!!<BR>||||reg||1
